Result(res);\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * 处理galaxy返回的数据结果 将新结果返回前端界面\r\n */\r\nvar result = postHandle(galaxyRes,\"appName\",\"sequenceGapLossPercent\");\r\nprintln(jsonUtil.toJsonStr(galaxyRes));\r\n\r\nreturn result;');
